          "correction": "Export the JSON at the exact configured/selected Stage3 CODE_PATH (or explicitly update the Stage3 variant configuration to this artifact) and key each SID row by item_ids[row] from the sidecar. Keep the NPY row-indexed only if its consumer explicitly uses the same row mapping."
        }
